# source masters — keep these out of git; they live in asset storage.
# Only the web-optimized derivatives under public/ belong here.
#
# Leading slash is REQUIRED. Unanchored `Images/` matches a directory of that
# name at any depth, and git runs with core.ignorecase=true on macOS, so it
# also swallowed all of `public/images/` — silently ignoring every web image.
/Images/
public/models/*.gltf
*.psd
*.ai
